Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别说什么“但是”什么“可是”了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会抛弃真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体… 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，看来我能陪你走的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古… 他的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足以媲美米扎艾尔·阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法与你并肩作战，抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我把卡托付给你…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）呵呵呵… 看来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体已经到极限了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）游马君！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那家伙 到底想干什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 接住这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会我会同时守护星光界和真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，愚蠢的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有星光界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还要一边护着那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还想赢过我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我至少能自己保护自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤闪亮滑翔者！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上有超量怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.74,0:01:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手就无法攻击我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马这样我就没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:01:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤隆隆石魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《敌人的巨人之手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然能无效怪兽效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但攻击力很低。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有盖牌（埋伏卡）的现在正是机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普破坏，再用巨像兵攻击》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普！ 攻击巨手！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普 怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 你的怪兽已经完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自爆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自爆？ 开什么玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才巨手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到秘孔死爆无惚的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运就已经注定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到秘孔死爆无惚的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗开始的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会无条件 爆炸。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不止这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你将会受到相当于霍普攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人手的真正恐怖之处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就好好尝个够吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动闪光史莱姆的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）闪光史莱姆在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将该玩家所控制的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使伤害无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，游马同学就回避了伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动巨人手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方怪兽发动效果时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将该效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽 秘孔死爆无惚！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 重新接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受希望攻击力数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五死眼光！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果 你所做的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不但没能守住同伴 还白白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把怪兽从场上消灭掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连自己的怪兽都变得 无法攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你干出来的好事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。都怪我多此一举…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再想别的办法就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《话虽如此 我的生命值只剩900。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古毫发无伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的下个回合要是被攻击的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中发动永续魔法 炎之护封剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张卡在场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都无法进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有怪兽召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.55,0:06:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡就会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样一来 暂时能撑过去了》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马明明是我让状况变糟的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是说了别在意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙装什么好人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩什么友情游戏啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙的假面具我来给你们撕下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！ 来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}埋葬你们这帮家伙的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动升阶魔法·魅影之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.85,0:07:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将巨手升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阶级4的巨手 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为… 为了驾驭这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削减我的生命 作为饲料的契约。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命被削减… 不断被削减…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我不会犹豫。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧，阿里特！》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌幻影·变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！CNo.106！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掌握混沌世界之力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那拳头粉碎大地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那指尖贯穿天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}熔岩掌 巨手红！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是那家伙的 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨手红的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的 除这张卡以外的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有表侧表示的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}红漠无惚！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炎之护封剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来保护你们的东西已经没有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨型之手·红
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(狞笑)万死红掌！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 闪耀·抵抗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方怪兽的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 那个攻击力的一半伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我来承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我稍微派上点用场了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月… 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 别乱来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！ 居然自己主动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我好像也快到极限了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不快点做个了断的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把两张卡盖伏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻影之手·森林！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果每当回合轮到我时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有玩家都要受到1000点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的生命值是900和100。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 你们已经完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。但现在只能相信游马了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留给我们的回合只有一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 这次一定要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管我发生什么都绝对不要试图来救我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么样都无所谓。所以…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咬牙切齿)你在搞什么鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你挣扎扑腾 也已经太迟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们已经完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤闪光兔子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(闪光兔子)嘿 看我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 闪光桥！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光兔子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)而且 这次直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能破坏敌人的魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。目标是破坏场地魔法吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，闪亮兔子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动，恶爪之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有名字带“手”的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只怪兽的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，给予被无效攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽攻击力800分的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了！被地狱之炎焚烧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向亚里特忏悔吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡，绝望守护！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝望守护！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡要支付一半的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个伤害无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是笨蛋吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩友情过家家也该有个限度吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我不是说过那么多次，不管发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不要管我了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我怎么可能做得到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有星光体都是我的伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我绝对不会抛弃任何人……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会抛弃任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个死缠烂打的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！死亡之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制怪兽的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡时发动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个玩家每有一张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成300点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌有3张。伤害是900！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就真的结束了！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！闪耀·重生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放自己场上的2只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将游马的手牌全部送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我的手牌！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果对方没有手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死亡手牌的效果就毫无意义了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月… 你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于闪耀·重生的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从游马的墓地 将怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到游马的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！No.39 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连 No.都把那家伙叫回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 闪亮复活的最后的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把自己的一张手牌 放到对方的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 用这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 限定型异晶之力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月 为什么你会有？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释之后再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想赢下这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救出星光体吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:15:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信我吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《异晶之力卡 由我来……》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《真月…… 有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信你》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！ 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}限定型·异热同心·之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)这张卡是 以自己场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级4以下的怪兽·超量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽 升阶为比它高一个阶级的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有混沌之名的怪兽·超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使其进化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)混沌超量·变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)出来吧！ CNo. 39！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统御混沌的 红色霸王！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)释放悠久的戒律{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为赫焉 驱散黑暗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧！ 希望皇 霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这就是 霍普的进化…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这是你的新力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那个就是 霍普？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)新的进化…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底在场地里发生了什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 把 No.卡升级了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种力量人类不可能拥有…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！ 霍普雷V的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用混沌超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏巨手红魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷V V字剑射击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 给予对手相当于被破坏怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷V 直接攻击基拉古。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑V字斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢… 赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 你这家伙到底是什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早你会明白的。迟早。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次又发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里面看不见啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我感动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为朋友着想的心是货真价实的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也，就从现在起把你称作朋友吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等、等一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我完全搞不懂到底是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月，你到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是巴利安守护者。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安……守护者？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是守护者。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:20:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你们世界的话来说就像警察一样的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……哎哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 你这家伙是巴利安吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人都赢了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了游马君 总算是赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得我一直在拖游马君的后腿。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)嘿嘿嘿 别笑啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这是为你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 给你这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 谢啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你赢了…… 看来是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 关于阿斯特拉尔的事也。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)嗯。我从一开始就能看到他的身影。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:21:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的任务是找出邪恶的巴利安并将其排除。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安也有善恶之分啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然了。巴利安世界并不是恶的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也有心怀正义的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今天起我也和你一起守护星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的。好厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是巴利安那边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有同伴这件事被知道了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界那家伙肯定会吓一跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这件事是你和我之间的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是规矩。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个世界里必须以真月零的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}行事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得好麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以关于我的事帮我保密。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，从今天起你就是我的部下了。好好拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}部下！？不是搭档之类的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了无所谓。从今天起我就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界警察的帅气刑警了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂真月 救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
